- Dumbbells
- Exercise Bikes
- Sports Equipment

RETURN POLICY
-------------
1. Products can be returned within 15 days.
2. Equipment damaged by misuse is not eligible.

WARRANTY POLICY
---------------
1. Fitness machines include a 1-year warranty.
2. Motors may carry up to a 3-year warranty.

==================================================
ORDER CANCELLATION POLICY
==================================================

1. Orders can be cancelled before shipment.
2. Shipped orders cannot be cancelled.
3. Pre-orders can be cancelled any time before release.
4. Refunds for cancelled orders are processed within 3-5 business days.

==================================================
DELIVERY POLICY
==================================================

1. Standard Delivery: 3-7 business days.
2. Express Delivery: 1-2 business days.
3. Tracking details are provided after shipment.
4. Delivery delays due to weather or natural disasters are outside company control.

==================================================
REFUND POLICY
==================================================

1. Refunds are initiated after inspection approval.
2. Refund processing requires 5-7 business days.
3. Refunds are credited to the original payment method.
4. Shipping charges are non-refundable.
5. Gift cards are non-refundable.

==================================================
CUSTOMER SUPPORT POLICY
==================================================

1. Support is available 24/7.
2. Customers should provide:
   - Order ID
   - Customer Name
   - Product Name
   - Issue Description

3. Support agents must:
   - Be polite and professional.
   - Personalize responses.
   - Follow company policies.
   - Never promise actions that violate company rules.